7473", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473396573_1030121745610806_363182968852538317_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wdl-WjxNUF0Q7kNvwHWQaTk&_nc_oc=Adl1uKLQ9A5RpQ6qEtnOqf_q4iBOhclzwKewiNg7GwskR3bql3ij7TgxVcO9PxVqLpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwavR-VKZyAo9M_HIyyxh2k4fRpbJ9yQDa6WzGw7ab6vg&oe=69B93447"}, {"file_name": "Crossbow_ScreenShot.png", "id": "2397984983893950", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391978_2397984990560616_3969625957978599437_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ea-8rV_OfSYQ7kNvwFv_vTW&_nc_oc=AdlEvi_gA341s5LsbzCNTGJqxZm7DPBjSbTQ4JplPSGcvVYHbV4QWC2hyuhNv6_sYlM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzw__yuQqH3k5VkHs8hbwKKiUpgdaBj1Vo-VZ2V_sDv3w&oe=69B939ED"}, {"file_name": "Olympic_ScreenShot.png", "id": "648582874300164", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392305_648582880966830_2648986520125630881_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aocBWviVS-oQ7kNvwE6nYS2&_nc_oc=Adm9_ZoYqjl1x6RwEtkPEdkL9cIpnMP_DNsPP8B6o_Hsyc720PzI0mr2T-UYHrG_WEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxBrdSZndW7IgRfIbMgS4re9f8yvBA6RYqDKAqUR44T7A&oe=69B938E1"}, {"file_name": "BallonPop_Screenshot.png", "id": "2053609291789381", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391967_2053609295122714_5342321999149614343_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v3K0kt3djZUQ7kNvwGczw9W&_nc_oc=AdmhJ7TrBJpx2rrqQ1TzUZ_Tq9hOhJV5HymQ0XuCg5sFo3Xqp4zTcvR58PQz0XmxYlU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzgDVyqxhlCJI6lCc2zwllbmz4ewXUFJFAwFAmokqBttw&oe=69B94BB8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "vArcher", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "arrow", "archer", "simulator"], "long_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. \n\n**Customizable Arrows:**\n- Choose from a variety of tips, shafts, fletchings and nocks\n- Each part contributes to the total weight and properties of the arrow\n\n**Bows:**\n- English Long Bow\n- Recurve Bow\n- Compound Bow\n- Japanese Yumi\n- Medieval Crossbow\n\n**Tuning and Tweaking**\n- Customize bow parameters like Draw Weight, Draw Length and IBO Speed to match your real bow setup or get a feel for a new one\n- Hone the perfect shot with features like string-walking, multiple string release methods and micro offsets for hand positions\n- Add attachments like stabilizers, sights and more\n- Save and load multiple configurations for each bow\n\n**Ranges and Targets**\n- Includes Indoor and Outdoor ranges with customizable targets and distances\n- Freely place targets in The Sandbox Range for a unique 3D shooting experience\n- Choose from a variety of targets like standard Rounds, tumbling blocks, playing cards, balloons and of course, Apples\n- Get instant shot feedback for Bullseye targets via hit marker displays\n\n**Challenge Ranges**\n- Test your skill in a variety of special challenges and chase high scores", "short_description": "A Comprehensive archery range simulation featuring multiple customizable bows, arrows and targets.  Physically accurate parameters let you experience shooting bows from the comfort of home. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/varcher-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meatspace Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.meatspacevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUI